        "accession_number": "0000720005-25-000093",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also compete with companies that offer web-based financial services and discount brokerage services to individual clients, usually with lower levels of service and financial technology companies (“fintechs”).",
